### List tools using X-BASE-URL
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-BASE-URL: https://api.example.com

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "openapi": {
        "openapi": "3.0.0",
        "info": { "title": "My API", "version": "1.0.0" },
        "paths": {}
      }
    }
  }
}

### Call a tool with an inline OpenAPI spec
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-BASE-URL: https://api.example.com

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "listUsers",
    "arguments": {},
    "_meta": {
      "openapi": {
        "openapi": "3.0.0",
        "info": { "title": "My API", "version": "1.0.0" },
        "paths": {
          "/users": {
            "get": {
              "operationId": "listUsers",
              "summary": "List users"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

### List tools using _meta.base_url (no X-BASE-URL header)
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "base_url": "https://api.example.com",
      "openapi": {
        "openapi": "3.0.0",
        "info": { "title": "My API", "version": "1.0.0" },
        "paths": {}
      }
    }
  }
}

### Call a tool using _meta.baseurl (no X-BASE-URL header)
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "listUsers",
    "arguments": {},
    "_meta": {
      "baseurl": "https://api.example.com",
      "openapi": {
        "openapi": "3.0.0",
        "info": { "title": "My API", "version": "1.0.0" },
        "paths": {
          "/users": {
            "get": {
              "operationId": "listUsers",
              "summary": "List users"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
